{{!--
  Two shapes of the same email. `isInvitationAccepted` is "true" when a master
  admin ticked "accept the invitation automatically" on the invite form, or
  when the recipient is already a member of the project, has not signed up
  yet, and has just been added to another of its teams by address (a member
  who has signed up is not emailed, #8568): the membership is already
  accepted, so there is nothing for the recipient to accept, and telling them
  to go and accept it would send them looking for an invitation that is not
  there.

  `ifCond` compares two values and takes no boolean operators, so the isNewUser
  split is nested inside each branch rather than combined. The `else` arms keep
  the original invitation wording for anything that does not set the variable.

  Who invited them (#7471, Server/Utils/TeamMember/InvitationInviter):
  `inviterLabel` is "Ada Walker (ada@walk.co)", and `inviterName` "Ada
  Walker" - a name the reader knows, and the address to check it by. Both are
  the inviter's own words, so they are printed escaped (plainInfo), never as
  HTML. An invitation that names nobody - one OneUptime, an API key or a
  workflow made - reads as it always did.
--}}

{{!--
  `isSsoSignIn` is "true" when every project the person would be in manages
  their sign-in with single sign-on, or the server requires it (#9819,
  SsoManagedSignIn.getManagedByOnceIn): they have no password to create, so
  the email offers SSO instead, linking to `ssoSignInLink` - the sign-up page
  an invitation opens, which then offers the project's own providers, or the
  Sign in with SSO page for someone signed up already.
--}}

{{!--
  In the invitee's language (#9897): the one their account picked, else the
  inviter's, else English (TeamMemberService.buildInvitationEmail, and
  Common/Types/Team/InvitationEmailWords for why). Every sentence is looked
  up whole by its English (tt, t), with the project's name, who invited
  them and the product as values put in as written - escaped by the slot
  they go in, and set apart to read their own way in an email read from the
  right (ServerTranslation). The link's label is LinkBlock's own.
--}}

{{#ifCond isInvitationAccepted "true"}}

{{> EmailTitle title=(tt "You've Been Added to {{project}}" project=projectName) }}

{{#ifCond isSsoSignIn "true"}}
{{#if inviterLabel}}
{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=(tt "{{inviter}} added you to {{project}} on {{product}}. It signs you in with your organization's single sign-on (SSO), so there is no password to create." inviter=inviterLabel project=projectName product=(brandName))}}
{{else}}
{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=(tt "You've been added to a project on {{product}}. It signs you in with your organization's single sign-on (SSO), so there is no password to create." product=(brandName))}}
{{/if}}

{{> ButtonBlock buttonUrl=ssoSignInLink buttonText=(t "Sign In with SSO")}}

{{> VerticalSpace this}}

{{> LinkBlock linkUrl=ssoSignInLink}}
{{else}}
{{#ifCond isNewUser "true"}}
{{#if inviterLabel}}
{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=(tt "{{inviter}} added you to {{project}} on {{product}}. Create your account to get started - your access is already waiting for you." inviter=inviterLabel project=projectName product=(brandName))}}
{{else}}
{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=(tt "You've been added to a project on {{product}}. Create your account to get started - your access is already waiting for you." product=(brandName))}}
{{/if}}

{{> ButtonBlock buttonUrl=registerLink buttonText=(t "Create Your Account")}}

{{> VerticalSpace this}}

{{> LinkBlock linkUrl=registerLink}}
{{else}}
{{#if inviterLabel}}
{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=(tt "{{inviter}} added you to {{project}} on {{product}}. Sign in to get started - there is nothing for you to accept." inviter=inviterLabel project=projectName product=(brandName))}}
{{else}}
{{> InfoBlock plainInfo=(tt "You've been added to a project on {{product}}. Sign in to get started - there is nothing for you to accept." product=(brandName))}}
{{/if}}

{{> ButtonBlock buttonUrl=signInLink buttonText=(tt "Sign In to {{product}}" product=(brandName))}}

{{> VerticalSpace this}}

{{> LinkBlock linkUrl=signInLink}}
{{/ifCond}}
{{/ifCond}}

{{else}}

